            <PDBo:em_3d_fitting.entry_id>7ZBU</PDBo:em_3d_fitting.entry_id>
            <PDBo:em_3d_fitting.id>1</PDBo:em_3d_fitting.id>
            <PDBo:em_3d_fitting.details>The atomistic models of monomeric SARS-CoV-2 S1 protein and a Fab molecule,  extracted from PDB entries 7A92 and 5WI9, were docked in the cryo-EM map using Chimera. The NTD and the RBD of the spike subunit were replaced with the crystal structures from PDB entries 7B62 and 7OAO, respectively. Guided by the cryo-EM map, the model was adjusted and extended interactively in Coot and refined using phenix.real_space_refine.</PDBo:em_3d_fitting.details>
            <PDBo:em_3d_fitting.overall_b_value rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">81</PDBo:em_3d_fitting.overall_b_value>
            <PDBo:em_3d_fitting.ref_protocol>OTHER</PDBo:em_3d_fitting.ref_protocol>
            <PDBo:em_3d_fitting.ref_space>REAL</PDBo:em_3d_fitting.ref_space>
            <PDBo:em_3d_fitting.target_criteria>Correlation coefficient</PDBo:em_3d_fitting.target_criteria>
          </PDBo:em_3d_fitting>
        </PDBo:has_em_3d_fitting>
      </PDBo:em_3d_fittingCategory>
    </PDBo:has_em_3d_fittingCategory>
